 equipped with a map\n<MATH_0010>\nwhere the second arrow uses the identification\n<MATH_0011>.\nBy adjointness of <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> we get a morphism\n<MATH_0014>.\nWe omit the verification that the morphism <MATH_0015>\nassociated to this map is exactly the immersion <MATH_0016>.\nHence the result follows from\npart (6) of Lemma <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b004ef56308947bdf5bb6a540a7bac87eadec2b620281067f921a2d1e6048a08", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:01VN:proof/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:600b05bfc027af098ba60da1f57ac81d6403e6c479b756bccbe3a0dcf8fb421f", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p1-29-morphisms-p034.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:9179410112f9c73c2201c1662eb8bb24a4edca98222a657132f3e24247e4659f", "path": "docs/evidence/p1-29-morphisms-p034-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:95672dd3fad9aac4cfeb8a0b18ab9db3f44c3f618fff60802897fdfb9a839715"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": ["tag:01VM:statement", "tag:01VN:statement"], "policy_revision": "git:c0c436b9d7ac86a6d277fd74ff439fd2389bdb84", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p1-29-morphisms-p034", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a21bc3-47e9-7122-97e6-0dbe2105e59d", "unit_id": "tag:01VL:prose-0002"}, "context_hash": "sha256:e41af85645e04aa10b24429172091a486b261510ceec12f536978e6a72822b19", "created_at": "2026-11-27T06:48:33.940Z", "glossary_revision": "git:c0c436b9d7ac86a6d277fd74ff439fd2389bdb84", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.172.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.2-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.2-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.2-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-p1-29-morphisms-p034", "schema_version"